所以我只想读一篇，因为也许我们会让它成为一项常规功能。

00:46:24.980 --> 00:46:29.539
But this one says, hey Josh, I'm sending you this message from France.
但这个人说，嘿乔希，我从法国给你发了这条消息。

00:46:29.539 --> 00:46:35.340
I don't know if you really love being recognized this Ted Mosby, but today I want to talk to you about it.
我不知道你是否真的喜欢被认出是特德·莫斯比，但今天我想和你谈谈。

00:46:35.340 --> 00:46:44.179
I need to talk to you about it because tonight for the third time I finished how I met your mother and for the third time I cried a lot.
我需要和你谈谈这件事，因为今晚我第三次讲完我是如何遇见你母亲的，第三次我哭了很多。

00:46:44.179 --> 00:46:49.780
I'm 17 and I really grew up watching this series and I mean in every way possible.
我今年 17 岁，我真的是看着这个系列节目长大的，我的意思是在所有可能的方面。

00:46:49.780 --> 00:47:00.179
I went through a lot of very bad times and you were always there to make me laugh and believe again, you were there to instruct me really important things about life, every episode had something to teach me.
我经历了很多非常糟糕的时光，你总是在那里让我欢笑并再次相信，你在那里指导我关于生活的真正重要的事情，每一集都有一些东西可以教给我。

00:47:00.179 --> 00:47:05.489
Like I, just like your character, believe a lot in destiny, maybe too much.
就像我，就像你的性格一样，非常相信命运，也许是太过分了。

00:47:05.489 --> 00:47:06.769
I love too much.
我太爱了。

00:47:06.769 --> 00:47:08.849
I do everything too much.
我做的一切都太多了。

00:47:08.849 --> 00:47:12.000
And sometimes I'm worrying if I shouldn't just stop.
有时我会担心我是否不应该停下来。

00:47:12.000 --> 00:47:19.110
But thanks to how I met your mother, I'll never worry again because this is me and I'm never gonna change.
但多亏了我认识你母亲的方式，我再也不会担心了，因为这就是我，我永远不会改变。

00:47:19.110 --> 00:47:20.989
I'll still be me forever.
我永远还是我。

00:47:20.989 --> 00:47:24.228
So what I want to say is a big thank you, Josh, everything.
所以我想说的是，非常感谢你，乔什，一切。

00:47:24.228 --> 00:47:27.467
By the way, I listened to your songs and they are a legend.
顺便说一下，我听过你的歌，它们是一个传奇。

00:47:27.467 --> 00:47:28.510
Wait for it, Derry.
等等，德里。

00:47:29.389 --> 00:47:30.314
So that's awesome.
所以这太棒了。

00:47:30.314 --> 00:47:30.814
Yeah.
是的。

00:47:30.814 --> 00:47:32.048
I like to pick that one.
我喜欢选那个。

00:47:32.048 --> 00:47:36.673
I don't want it to seem like I was like, let's pick the one where they mentioned my music.
我不想让别人觉得我在想，让我们选一个他们提到我的音乐的吧。

00:47:39.389 --> 00:47:40.306
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:47:40.306 --> 00:47:41.529
Please equip me.
请装备我。

00:47:41.529 --> 00:47:42.981
All sins off again.
一切罪孽再次消散。

00:47:42.981 --> 00:47:44.050
New York City.
纽约市。

